      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。年轻世代主张\n“千明代表一定会缔造新的神话”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e470ac7162b260cad00edfa5df3a4f95a26e03fe995658d3acc0fd7b40bbbdae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
