      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而上个世代则表示“实力的确很强，\n但是仍比不上那个神话──\n三冠赛马娘所留下的成就”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d056fb9aa458cf33cee6273997b8772dff4a0127ebf3f6fcf027bb4b5ac04140",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
