      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尤其对年轻世代来说，\n千明小姐是第一个，\n成为史上最强赛马娘的希望！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1136b8b4d73a66782941e5ab53149769ab9198a086e6266e41b7b0f802e3028",
